Title: Markup in the Action

INT. SIGNAL BOX - NIGHT

<script>window.__trapped = 'action'</script>

<img src="x" onerror="window.__trapped = 'img'"> sits on the desk.

<a href="javascript:window.__trapped='link'">Press here</a> says the sign.

<!-- an HTML comment where action goes -->

<iframe src="https://example.invalid/"></iframe>

WREN
<style>body { display: none }</style>
Nothing here runs.
